The plane is in Copenhagen.
I look out of the small window.
The sky is grey.
I am happy.
And I am also a little nervous.
My name is Maya.
I am thirty-one years old.
I come from Mexico.
I am a software engineer.
Now I am in Denmark.
This is a new city.
And a new life.
I have a new job here.
Copenhagen is my new home now.
I am ready.
